-----------------------
Modified Classes:
- LoginWorkflow (added performLoginWithRememberMe method)

Affected Tests:
- UserLoginTest.test.ts
- AdminLoginTest.test.ts
- GuestLoginTest.test.ts

Execution Results:
✅ UserLoginTest: PASSED
✅ AdminLoginTest: PASSED
✅ GuestLoginTest: PASSED

Status: All regression tests passed - backward compatibility confirmed
```

