## ✅ 5.4 100% Test Success Mandate (MANDATORY)

### **Success Requirements**
- **(MANDATORY)** **Zero failures**: All test scenarios must pass - no exceptions
- **(MANDATORY)** **Zero skipped**: No skipped tests allowed
- **(MANDATORY)** All test steps execute successfully
- **(MANDATORY)** All assertions pass
- **(MANDATORY)** No unexpected errors or warnings

### **If Test Fails**

**Analyze Failure**:
- Review test execution logs
- Identify failure point
- Check element locators
- Verify page navigation
- Review action completion

**Fix Issues**:
- Update locators if needed
- Add missing verification steps
- Fix timing issues (add waitFor calls)
- Adjust navigation logic
- Fix data generation issues

**Regenerate**:
- Apply fixes to generated code
- Re-execute test
- Repeat until 100% pass rate achieved

**Retry Logic**:
- Implement retry mechanisms for flaky elements (if needed)
- Add comprehensive error handling
- Ensure test data doesn't cause conflicts

